    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Koolekeja kakenaagūlīlwe ka Yelusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'wana wa munhū, solaga lūshū lūūgī, ūlūtūmamīle gītī lūgembe lwa moogi, ūgūmooge ū ntwe gwako nī ndezu jako; ūsole n'ipimīlo lya kūjipimīla ī nzwīlī, ūjigabanhye mabbipi adatū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shikū jako ja koolecha kūpīndīlījiwa kwa nzengo ūlū jūshikaana, ibbipi lya kwandya ū mu nzwīlī jenījo ūkūlīponeja mu moto mumo nzengo jijige. Ibbipi lya kabīlī ūkūlīsola ūje būlī kwene ū mu nzengo ūkūjipuugagūlaga na lūshū; ī lya kadatū ūkūjisaamula jisambaajiwe nyaga. Hūna ū nene nakūbasolela lūshū naje nakūbakūūbīlījaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūkwīnja tūywīlī tūgeehu ūtūpalige ūtūbise mu lūpembe lwa ng'wenda gwako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama hangī ū mu twenūto ūsola tūgehu ūtūponeje mu moto tūnogotele. Ū kūfuma ū ng'wenūmo gūkūbuguma moto gwīsambaalīle pyī ī numba ya Isilaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī, ī yenīyī h'ī Yelusalemu, nītūūla ha gatī ya mahanga; yūpīndiwa sī ningī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū mu būbi wayo yūshigomemela ī shilagīlo shane na a malange gane, kūgaheeba a mahanga nī sī ījo jīpīndije hose hose; īshilemile ī shilagīlo, nū kūshimzīla ū mu malange gane ītatogilwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī, A bing'we mulemile ū kūlembeela kūtinda pye a mahanga ayo gamupīndije hose hose. Na a malange gane mutatogilwe ū kūgadima, pyī nū kūshilondeela ī shilagīlo shane; na lūūlū mulīleba na a ha mahanga ū mu wigwi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī, Nene ng'wenekīlī nalī ng'wilwisha wako ū bebe Yelusalemu; nakūkūgwisīja nsango mu būtongi bo mahanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kūlwa nguno ya shiikolile shako sha malofu shose pyī īsho ūkashilamyaga, nakūkwītīla īyo nataalī kwīyīta na kamò, īyo natalīyīta na hangī yaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu bing'we a babyaji bakūyūbalya nyama a baana babo, na a baana bakūyūbalya a babyaji babo. Nakūmugwisīja nsango, hama abo balapūlūgūke ū mu bing'we nakūbasalang'hanya kūja hose hose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī, Ūmo nene nalī mpanga, īkī ī lipandī lyane lyeela ng'walīsosohagije na mashigīmbo ging'we ga malofu, na mashītīle ging'we g'ipelanya, nū nene nakūmumala, natūmuchīla shigongo nūūlū kūmukūlīlwa, nūūlū natūmulekeela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īmò ya ng'widatū ū mu bing'we bakūmalwa mabūsaatu, nūūlū bakūchīla mu nzengo kūlwa nzala; īmò ya ng'widatū bakūmalwa būlūgū hanze ya nzengo; hama īyī īmò ya ng'widatū īyo īlīsaagīīla nakūbasambaaja kūja hose hose, hūna nabasolele lūshū naje nakūbakūūbījaga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūlū nūbitīīla ū būpelanu bone, bakūdeeba gīkī nene SEEBA naahayile kūlwa būpelanu bone; ū būdaki bone būkūshila, nū būpelanu bone ūbo nalī nabo ū kūbo būkūkamīīla, nakūmala shiilī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūng'wīta mubize nsaka kū bose abo bakūbītaga, na bakwibengelejiwa ū mu mahanga ayo gamupīndije hose hose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū nūmugwisīja nsango mu būdaki na būpelanu, na mu kahūgūlīle ka kūminya, mukūbiza bibengelejiwa na basondagūlwa, banhū ba kwikala mukūdūkagūlagwa; shikolo sh'igekemaja ū kū mahanga ayo gamupīndije hose hose. Nene SEEBA nalīhaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū nūmulasa na masonga gane ga būsūngū bo nzala, nakūmulasa kūlwa kūmukenaagūla. Nakūyūng'wenhela nzala ja lwīsī lwīsī namumalīle gete ū būpandīkīlo bo shilīwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūmutūmīla nzala na mashiinū ga mu mapoolu gamumalīle a baana bing'we; mabūsaatu na fu shikūyikala shikūbītaga ū mu bing'we; hama nakūng'wenhela būlūgū. Nene SEEBA nalīhaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
